Subject: [PATCH 5/11] dt-bindings: phy: qcom: add SM6225 QMP UFS PHY

Add qcom,sm6225-qmp-ufs-phy to the compatible lists in the Qualcomm QMP
UFS PHY binding. This documents the compatible for the upstream QMP driver
port; no device-tree source is added here.

The SM6225 (Khaje) PHY is wired with nine clocks (the three reference
clocks plus the RX/TX symbol mux and PHY clocks), while the other SoCs
listed here use three. Move the compatible to its own conditional so the
clock list matches the hardware captured in the device tree.

---
diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
index f9cfbd0b2..6f16bda18 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
       - qcom,sa8775p-qmp-ufs-phy
       - qcom,sc7180-qmp-ufs-phy
       - qcom,sc7280-qmp-ufs-phy
+      - qcom,sm6225-qmp-ufs-phy
       - qcom,sc8180x-qmp-ufs-phy
       - qcom,sc8280xp-qmp-ufs-phy
       - qcom,sdm845-qmp-ufs-phy
@@ -113,6 +114,28 @@ allOf:
             - const: ref_aux
             - const: qref
 
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          contains:
+            const: qcom,sm6225-qmp-ufs-phy
+    then:
+      properties:
+        clocks:
+          minItems: 9
+          maxItems: 9
+        clock-names:
+          items:
+            - const: ref_clk_src
+            - const: ref_aux_clk
+            - const: qref_clk
+            - const: rx_sym0_mux_clk
+            - const: rx_sym1_mux_clk
+            - const: tx_sym0_mux_clk
+            - const: rx_sym0_phy_clk
+            - const: rx_sym1_phy_clk
+            - const: tx_sym0_phy_clk
+
   - if:
       properties:
         compatible:
